---
// Chapter 8: Visual before/after comparing a stark flat background against
// quiet background layers (subtle tonal band, faint dot grid, and gentle corner geometry)
// that break monotony without hurting text legibility.
// Uses site CSS tokens and unique SVG pattern/clipPath IDs per instance.

const W = 900;
const H = 365;
const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const dotPatternId = `fbd-dots-${uid}`;
const rightClipId = `fbd-right-clip-${uid}`;
---
<figure class="fbd">
  <div class="fbd-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after comparison showing a stark flat white hero and feature section on the left versus the same layout on the right enhanced with a subtle tonal surface band, a faint corner dot grid, and a low-contrast geometric arc.">
      <defs>
        <pattern id={dotPatternId} width="14" height="14" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <circle cx="3" cy="3" r="1.2" class="fbd-dot" />
        </pattern>
        <clipPath id={rightClipId}>
          <rect x="462" y="42" width="418" height="270" rx="10" />
        </clipPath>
      </defs>

      {/* Column headers */}
      <text x="20" y="28" class="fbd-head is-muted">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Before: stark flat background</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: nền phẳng đơn điệu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="462" y="28" class="fbd-head is-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>After: quiet background layers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: các lớp nền tách nhẹ</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* LEFT: Stark flat background */}
      <rect x="20" y="42" width="418" height="270" rx="10" class="fbd-frame-flat" />

      {/* Left hero copy */}
      <text x="44" y="88" class="fbd-hero-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Ship docs your team reads</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tài liệu dễ đọc cho cả nhóm</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="112" class="fbd-hero-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Versioned guides synced straight from Git.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng bộ phiên bản trực tiếp từ kho Git.</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="44" y="128" width="118" height="30" rx="6" class="fbd-btn-muted" />
      <text x="103" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="fbd-btn-text-muted">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Start free</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng thử</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left lower section (same flat white) */}
      <line x1="44" y1="184" x2="414" y2="184" class="fbd-hairline" />
      <text x="44" y="214" class="fbd-stat-num">99.98%</text>
      <text x="44" y="234" class="fbd-stat-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Uptime SLA</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cam kết hoạt động</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="236" y="214" class="fbd-stat-num">42 ms</text>
      <text x="236" y="234" class="fbd-stat-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Global search</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tìm kiếm toàn cục</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="44" y="288" class="fbd-note is-muted">
        <tspan data-lang-en>All sections blur into one flat plane.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi khu vực hòa lẫn trên cùng một nền phẳng.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* RIGHT: Quiet background layers */}
      <g clip-path={`url(#${rightClipId})`}>
        {/* Base surface */}
        <rect x="462" y="42" width="418" height="270" class="fbd-surface-base" />
        {/* 1. Subtle tonal band across upper hero */}
        <rect x="462" y="42" width="418" height="142" class="fbd-surface-band" />
        {/* 2. Faint dot grid tucked in upper right */}
        <rect x="706" y="42" width="174" height="142" fill={`url(#${dotPatternId})`} />
        {/* 3. Gentle low-contrast geometric shape in corner */}
        <circle cx="866" cy="72" r="88" class="fbd-geo-outer" />
        <circle cx="866" cy="72" r="52" class="fbd-geo-inner" />
      </g>
      <rect x="462" y="42" width="418" height="270" rx="10" class="fbd-frame-accent" />

      {/* Right hero copy (identical copy, crisp contrast) */}
      <text x="486" y="88" class="fbd-hero-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Ship docs your team reads</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tài liệu dễ đọc cho cả nhóm</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="486" y="112" class="fbd-hero-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Versioned guides synced straight from Git.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng bộ phiên bản trực tiếp từ kho Git.</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="486" y="128" width="118" height="30" rx="6" class="fbd-btn-accent" />
      <text x="545" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="fbd-btn-text-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Start free</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng thử</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right lower section (clean white contrasting with tonal band above — no line needed) */}
      <text x="486" y="214" class="fbd-stat-num">99.98%</text>
      <text x="486" y="234" class="fbd-stat-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Uptime SLA</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cam kết hoạt động</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="678" y="214" class="fbd-stat-num">42 ms</text>
      <text x="678" y="234" class="fbd-stat-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Global search</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tìm kiếm toàn cục</tspan>
      </text>

      <text x="486" y="288" class="fbd-note is-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tonal band + faint dots + corner arc; text stays crisp.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dải nền + lưới chấm mờ + vòng cung góc; chữ vẫn sắc nét.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom callout legend beneath right panel */}
      <text x="20" y="340" class="fbd-foot">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Needs a hard divider just to separate the hero from metrics.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phải kẻ đường ngang mới tách được phần đầu với số liệu.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="462" y="340" class="fbd-foot is-accent">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Background tone defines the break naturally at low contrast.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chênh tông nền tự tạo ranh giới rõ ràng ở độ tương phản thấp.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Quiet background decoration behaves like paper grain: a subtle tonal band, faint dot grid, and corner geometry add visual interest without competing with the copy.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nền trang trí nhẹ hoạt động như vân giấy: một dải màu chênh sáng, lưới chấm mờ và khối hình học ở góc tạo chiều sâu mà không tranh chấp với chữ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fbd { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fbd-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .fbd svg { width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }

  .fbd-head { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .fbd-head.is-muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fbd-head.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }

  .fbd-frame-flat { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .fbd-frame-accent { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-opacity: 0.4; stroke-width: 1.25; }

  .fbd-surface-base { fill: var(--bg); }
  .fbd-surface-band { fill: var(--bg-alt); }
  .fbd-dot { fill: var(--text-muted); fill-opacity: 0.25; }
  .fbd-geo-outer { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .fbd-geo-inner { fill: var(--red); fill-opacity: 0.08; }

  .fbd-hero-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fbd-hero-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }

  .fbd-btn-muted { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fbd-btn-text-muted { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .fbd-btn-accent { fill: var(--red); }
  .fbd-btn-text-accent { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: #ffffff; }

  .fbd-hairline { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fbd-stat-num { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fbd-stat-label { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }

  .fbd-note { font-size: 12.5px; }
  .fbd-note.is-muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fbd-note.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }

  .fbd-foot { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fbd-foot.is-accent { fill: var(--red); }

  .fbd figcaption { margin-top: 0.8em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
